---
/**
 * Closing call to action.
 *
 * Phase 1 keeps the export exactly as signed off: a mailto CTA and the address
 * beneath it. Phase 2 adds the inline Calendly embed and the contact form
 * below this block.
 */
---

<section id="contact" class="cta section" data-section="cta">
  <div class="cta__inner">
    <h2 class="cta__head">Send me your MMP setup. I'll tell you what's broken in it.</h2>
    <p class="cta__lead">
      A 30-minute call, no pitch. I'll name the specific gaps I can see and what each one is likely
      costing. If there's nothing wrong, I'll tell you that too &#8212; it's the fastest way for both
      of us to find out whether this is worth a conversation.
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:hello@e2eapps.com" class="btn-amber cta__btn">Book a call</a>
    <div class="cta__email">hello@e2eapps.com</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    background: var(--c-ink-deep);
  }

  .cta__inner {
    max-width: var(--wrap-cta);
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta__head {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2-cta);
    color: var(--c-paper);
  }

  .cta__lead {
    margin: var(--space-md) auto 0;
    max-width: var(--measure-cta-lead);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-xl);
    color: rgba(var(--rgb-paper), 0.68);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .cta__btn {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
  }

  .cta__email {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-mono-md);
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
  }
</style>
